  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GIVE A MENSTRUATION  KIT TO KEEP A GIRL IN SCHOOL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With your support, we wish to help many teenagers to have a bright future by staying in school during her periods. With USD 17, you will have helped a girl not only to get a Menstruation kit but also stay in school hence reducing the literacy problem and allow this young girl be self-sustaining when she finishes her education and find or create a job opportunity. Your donation further will impact the country when few domestic violence issues will be recorded, less or no child abuses</narrative>
  </description>
